	\L_0385c:
	ZH 1:
	'When Miki stood next to Rance,'
	R
	'Hornet and Satella kneeled.'
	\L_03949:
	\L_0393c:
	\L_03894:
	ZH 1:
	'Uh... Ah... Um...'
	R
	'These people...'
	R
	'Um...'
	\L_03949:
	\L_0393c:
	\L_03824:
	ZH 1:
	'They want you to be the Demon'
	R
	'Lord.'
	\L_03949:
	\L_0393c:
	\L_03894:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah...'
	\L_03949:
	\L_0393c:
	\L_038f6:
	!VAR0516 : 35!
	\L_038e8:
	\L_03894:
	ZH 1:
	'Shall I introduce myself?'
	\L_03949:
	ZH 1:
	'I believe you’ve heard of me'
	R
	'through Satella.'
	\L_03949:
	ZH 1:
	'My name is Hornet...'
	\L_03949:
	ZH 1:
	'The daughter of Demon Lord Gai,'
	R
	'the man that chose you as his'
	R
	'successor.'
	\L_03949:
	ZH 1:
	'Ms. Miki... You should become'
	R
	'the Demon Lord.'
	\L_03949:
	ZH 1:
	'That would be the best thing for'
	R
	'peace for everybody.'
	\L_03949:
	ZH 1:
	'Demon Lord Gai wished for this'
	R
	'as well.'
	\L_03949:
	ZH 1:
	'Without a Demon Lord with'
	R
	'absolute power, the world will'
	R
	'fall into ruin.'
	\L_03949:
	\L_0393c:
	\L_0385c:
	ZH 1:
	'Some frustration could be'
	R
	'heard in Hornet’s voice.'
	\L_03949:
	\L_0393c:
	\L_038f6:
	!VAR0516 : 54!
	\L_038e8:
	\L_03894:
	ZH 1:
	'...But... I...'
	\L_03949:
	\L_0393c:
	\L_03824:
	ZH 1:
	'Listen, Miki.'
	R
	'The world will be at peace'
	R
	'even without a Demon Lord.'
	\L_03949:
	ZH 1:
	'Since it’s got me. There only'
	R
	'needs to be one person with'
	R
	'absolute power.'
	\L_03949:
	ZH 1:
	'But it’ll be me, not the Demon'
	R
	'Lord.'
	\L_03949:
	\L_0393c:
	\L_03894:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_03949:
	\L_0393c:
	\L_03824:
	ZH 1:
	'So you don’t need to become'
	R
	'the Demon Lord, Miki.'
	\L_03949:
	ZH 1:
	'But what’ll you do? You decide.'
	R
	'Will you become the Demon Lord'
	R
	'like Hornet here asks?'
	\L_03949:
	\L_0393c:
	\L_03894:
	ZH 1:
	'...............'
	\L_03949:
	\L_0393c:
	\L_038f6:
	!VAR0516 : 35!
	\L_038e8:
	\L_03894:
	ZH 1:
	'Little Princess...'
	\L_03949:
	\L_0393c:
	\L_038f6:
	!VAR0516 : 54!
	\L_038e8:
	\L_03894:
	ZH 1:
	'...Um... I...'
	\L_03949:
	ZH 1:
	'I’m sorry!'
	\L_03949:
	\L_0393c:
	\L_0385c:
	ZH 1:
	'Miki faced Hornet and bowed'
	R
	'deeply.'
	\L_03949:
	\L_0393c:
	\L_03894:
	ZH 1:
	'I... wanna be human.'
	R
	'I wanna become human again.'
	\L_03949:
	\L_0393c:
	\L_0385c:
	ZH 1:
	'Normally a cry-baby, Miki held'
	R
	'back her tears and spoke'
	R
	'clearly.'
	\L_03949:
	\L_0393c:
	\L_038f6:
	!VAR0516 : 35!
	\L_038e8:
	\L_03894:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_03949:
	\L_0393c:
	\L_03824:
	ZH 1:
	'So that’s how it is.'
	R
	'Got that, Hornet?'
	\L_03949:
	\L_0393c:
	\L_0385c:
	ZH 1:
	'Hornet stood up without saying'
	R
	'anything.'
	\L_03949:
	\L_0393c:
	\L_03894:
	ZH 1:
	'Understood. I would like Little'
	R
	'Princess... excuse me, Ms. Miki'
	R
	'to be happy as well.'
	\L_03949:
	ZH 1:
	'I won’t force her.'
	\L_03949:
	ZH 1:
	'Just allow me one request.'
	\L_03949:
	\L_0393c:
	\L_038f6:
	!VAR0516 : 54!
	\L_038e8:
	\L_03894:
	ZH 1:
	'Huh...?'
	\L_03949:
	\L_0393c:
	\L_038f6:
	!VAR0516 : 35!
	\L_038e8:
	\L_03894:
	ZH 1:
	'Former Demon Lord Gai ordered me'
	R
	'to protect Ms. Miki...'
	\L_03949:
	ZH 1:
	'Please, at least allow me to'
	R
	'carry out that order.'
	\L_03949:
	ZH 1:
	'I’d like to be Ms. Miki’s'
	R
	'guard from now on.'
	\L_03949:
	\L_0393c:
	\L_038f6:
	!VAR0516 : 54!
	\L_038e8:
	\L_03894:
	ZH 1:
	'...Huh...?'
	\L_03949:
	\L_0393c:
	\L_038f6:
	!VAR0516 : 75!
	\L_038e8:
	\L_03894:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah...'
	\L_03949:
	ZH 1:
	'I’m following Ms. Hornet.'
	R
	'Please let me be Li-...'
	R
	'Ms. Miki’s guard too!'
	\L_03949:
	\L_0393c:
	\L_03824:
	ZH 1:
	'Mm, well, alright.'
	R
	'Should be harmless, Miki.'
	\L_03949:
	\L_0393c:
	\L_038f6:
	!VAR0516 : 54!
	\L_038e8:
	\L_03894:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah... Okay.'
	R
	'I look forward to working with'
	R
	'you.'
	\L_03949:
	\L_0393c:
	\L_0385c:
	ZH 1:
	'Miki frantically bowed again.'
	\L_03949:
	\L_0393c:
	\L_038f6:
	!VAR0516 : 35!
	\L_038e8:
	\L_03894:
	ZH 1:
	'I do as well, Ms. Miki.'
	\L_03949:
	\L_0393c:
	\L_03886:
	\L_0385c:
	ZH 1:
	'Thus, Hornet joined Rance.'
	\L_03949:
	\L_0393c:
